{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2026/09/22.html#a181803","date":1790101083000,"content":"Yesterday I posted a list of <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/helloFrontier/blob/master/docs/verbs.md\">builtin verbs</a> in Frontier, as implemented in our current Atlantis app. Today I asked Claude to update the list, I wanted to see which verbs were <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/helloFrontier/blob/master/docs/verbs.md#implemented\">implemented</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/scripting/helloFrontier/blob/master/docs/verbs.md#notImplemented\">not implemented</a>.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"3b5447881e576cd34692451972edddedfbb0470b32b09ff787e36a8500d7cef0","category":"Sites"}